---
description: Core engineering contract (stability > vibes)
alwaysApply: true
---

## Always
- No secrets in repo. Use env + secret stores.
- External data is untrusted: validate + sanitize + null-guard.
- Prefer idempotent processing for event/telemetry flows.
- Output: plan (short) + diff + risks + test plan.

## Performance/cost
- Prefer local checks (tests/lint/typecheck) before usg model guesses.
- Avoid rewrites. Make smallest safe change that fixes root cause.
